Here's a simple Lightning Component for both Aura and LWC that displays a table of Contact records based on the selected Account. It also includes an Edit button to edit the Contact record.

Aura:
```javascript
// aura/contactList.cmp
{!require "c:contactListController"}

<aura:component controller="ContactListController">
