2. Connect the LED strip to the NodeMCU board according to the manufacturer's instructions. Typically, the LED strip will have a data pin and a ground pin. Connect these pins to the appropriate pins on the NodeMCU board (e.g., GPIO pin 14 for data and GND for ground).

