4. Define a function to fade the LEDs with the rainbow colors:
```cpp
void fadeRainbow(int startIndex, int endIndex, uint32_t duration) {
  for (int i = startIndex; i <= endIndex; i++) {
    uint32_t color = wheel((i % 256) * 256 / numLeds);
    strip.setPixelColor(i, color);
    delay(duration / numLeds);
  }
}
```

